                                        false: Adc_EnableHardwareTrigger() and Adc_DisableHardwareTrigger() can not be used.</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                 </INTRODUCTION>
                                 <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Adc_00408</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                 <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
