                                                         <SHORT-NAME>BswMRequestedModeMax</SHORT-NAME>
                                                         <DESC>
                                                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the upper limit for the modes requested by this mode requester.</L-2>
                                                         </DESC>
                                                         <INTRODUCTION>
                                                            <P>
                                                               <L-1 L="EN">The allowable range of this parameter shall coincide with the range of BswM_ModeType (which can be platform-dependent).</L-1>
                                                            </P>
