                                       <SHORT-NAME>CanIfTxPduReadNotifyStatus</SHORT-NAME>
                                       <DESC>
                                          <L-2 L="EN">Enables and disables transmit confirmation for each transmit CAN L-SDU for reading its notification status.</L-2>
                                       </DESC>
                                       <INTRODUCTION>
                                          <P>
                                             <L-1 L="EN">True: Enabled
                                                False: Disabled</L-1>
                                          </P>
