                                       <SHORT-NAME>CanTrcvHwPnSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                                       <DESC>
                                          <L-2 L="EN">Indicates whether the HW supports the selective wake-up function</L-2>
                                       </DESC>
                                       <INTRODUCTION>
                                          <P>
                                             <L-1 L="EN">TRUE = Selective wakeup feature is supported by the transceiver
