                                             <SHORT-NAME>ComMPncNmRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                                             <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">If this parameter equals true then every time a FULL Communication is requested due to a change in the PNC state machine to PNC_REQUESTED Nm shall be called using the API Nm_NetworkRequest.</L-2>
                                             </DESC>
