                                                        * Dbg_TraceRTEComSignalRx
                                                        * Dbg_TraceRTEComSignalIv
                                                        * Dbg_TraceRTEComCallback

                                                        The actual SignalId used in the debugging trace APIs is taken from the ComHandleId available at the ComSignal configuration of the Com module.</L-1>
                                                </P>
                                             </INTRODUCTION>
