                                                         <SHORT-NAME>DcmDsdSubServiceModeRuleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                                         <DESC>
                                                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to a DcmDspModeRule which controls the execution of the subservice.</L-2>
                                                         </DESC>
                                                         <INTRODUCTION>
                                                            <P>
                                                               <L-1 L="EN">If there is no reference configured, no mode rule check shall be performed.</L-1>
