                                                                     <SHORT-NAME>DcmDslProtocolRxPduId</SHORT-NAME>
                                                                     <DESC>
                                                                        <L-2 L="EN">Identifier of the PDU that is used for this reception channel.</L-2>
                                                                     </DESC>
