                                                   </DESC>
                                                   <INTRODUCTION>
                                                      <P>
                                                         <L-1 L="EN">Common authorization configuration taken from the referenced DcmDspStopRoutineCommonAuthorizationRef. If there is no reference, no check on the commonly defined authorization conditions shall be done to stop the routine.</L-1>
                                                      </P>
                                                   </INTRODUCTION>
