                                                                           <SHORT-NAME>DcmDspLinearScale</SHORT-NAME>
                                                                           <DESC>
                                                                              <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of an linear scale of the alternative Diagnosis Representation.</L-2>
                                                                           </DESC>
