                                        false: counter based debouncing support is disabled</L-1>
                                    </P>
                                 </INTRODUCTION>
                                 <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Dem_00724</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
