                                       <SHORT-NAME>DemFreezeFrameRecordNumber</SHORT-NAME>
                                       <DESC>
                                          <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines a record number for a freeze frame record. This record number is unique per freeze frame record number class.</L-2>
                                       </DESC>
