                                       <SHORT-NAME>EEP_E_COMPARE_FAILED</SHORT-NAME>
                                       <DESC>
                                          <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the DemEventParameter which shall be issued when the error "EEPROM compare failed (HW)" has occurred.</L-2>
                                       </DESC>
