                                             <SHORT-NAME>FrNmCarWakeUpFilterNodeId</SHORT-NAME>
                                             <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Source node identifier for CWU filtering. If CWU filtering is supported, only the CWU bit within the NM</L-2>
                                             </DESC>
                                             <INTRODUCTION>
                                                <P>
                                                   <L-1 L="EN">message with source node identifier FrNmCarWakeUpFilterNodeId is considered as CWU
                                                        request.</L-1>
                                                </P>
                                             </INTRODUCTION>
