                                             <SHORT-NAME>FrNmPnEraCalcEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                                             <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Specifies if FrNm calculates the PN request information for external requests. (ERA)</L-2>
                                             </DESC>
