                                       <SHORT-NAME>FrSMIsColdstartEcu</SHORT-NAME>
                                       <DESC>
                                          <L-2 L="EN">True: The ECU is a coldstart node for this FlexRay cluster.</L-2>
                                       </DESC>
                                       <INTRODUCTION>
                                          <P>
                                             <L-1 L="EN">False: The ECU is no coldstart node for this FlexRay cluster.</L-1>
                                          </P>
                                       </INTRODUCTION>
