                                          <P>
                                             <L-1 L="EN">In case the Measurement Mode is "IcuSignalMeasurement" and the properties "DutyCycle" or "Period" are set, the edge configured here is used as Default Period Start Edge.

                                                Implementation Type: Icu_ActivationType</L-1>
                                          </P>
                                       </INTRODUCTION>
