                                 <SHORT-NAME>IcuSignalMeasurementApi</SHORT-NAME>
                                 <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Adds / removes the services Icu_StartSignalMeasurement() and Icu_StopSignalMeasurement() from the code.</L-2>
                                 </DESC>
                                 <INTRODUCTION>
                                    <P>
