                                             <SHORT-NAME>J1939RmUserAckIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                                             <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Enable AckIndication for this module. In case of CDD, the name is &lt;apiServicePrefix&gt;_AckIndication. In case of RTE, the operation AckIndication of the required port J1939Rm_AckIndication_{user} is called.</L-2>
                                             </DESC>
                                             <INTRODUCTION>
                                                <P>
                                                   <L-1 L="EN">This parameter shall not be set for J1939RmUserType J1939RM_USER_J1939NM, J1939RM_USER_J1939DCM, or J1939RM_USER_COM.</L-1>
                                                </P>
                                             </INTRODUCTION>
                                             <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_J1939Rm_00028</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
