                                             <SHORT-NAME>LinIfScheduleTableIndex</SHORT-NAME>
                                             <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">This is the unique index used by upper layers to identify a schedule. Note that the NULL_SCHEDULE for each channel must have index 0.</L-2>
                                             </DESC>
