                                             <SHORT-NAME>SdServerTimerOfferCyclicDelay</SHORT-NAME>
                                             <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">Interval between cyclic offers in the main phase. This parameter is mandatory for ServerService.</L-2>
                                             </DESC>
